# Channel Intelligence Platform — Project Rules

## Platform Vision

Channel Intelligence Platform tracks the full stock journey: **OEM → Distributor → Retailer → Consumer**. It ingests messy commercial files (CSV/XLSX), standardizes entities via steward workflows, and surfaces explainable recommendations across inventory, buy plans, pricing, promos, competition, roadmap, and budgets. Every module follows a common pattern: upload → parse → map → validate → apply/commit → derive.

## Architecture Overview

```
apps/api/          FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2 async, Alembic migrations, Celery/Redis
apps/web/          Next.js 15 (App Router), React 19, MUI 6, AG Grid, TanStack Query, Zustand, Recharts
packages/ui/       Shared MUI theme tokens and AppThemeProvider
packages/types/    Shared TypeScript types (nav items, roles)
infra/docker/      Docker Compose — Postgres 16, Redis 7, API, web, worker containers
docs/              Architecture docs, data contracts, engineering notes
```

### Runtime Ports (local dev)

- **Web:** http://localhost:3000
- **API:** http://localhost:8001 (host direct) or http://localhost:8010 (Docker → container :8000)
- **Postgres:** localhost:5432, database `cip`
- **Redis:** localhost:6379

